pe-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Oglethorpe County came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years for May to June, June to July and November to December. In 2025, November to December ran 36% of normal on the middle, and October to November ran 69%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 40% of normal on the middle. Grid 16387 had its driest year in 1954 at 60%.</p>"}
